      "description": "Meta Ads Delivery Incident Reported",
      "details": "Meta's status page logged an Ads Delivery incident, indicating potential issues with ad delivery and pacing. Such incidents can lead to disruptions in campaign performance, where impressions may still serve but conversion intent drops due to underlying platform instability. Advertisers are advised to annotate these dates in their reporting dashboards.",
      "intensity": 2,
